 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal and complete: `homogeneousSubmodule` carries `_def`, introduction, span-elimination and the graded-monoid interaction; `pbwHomogeneousComponentMap` carries `_apply`, the generator-word formula, the homogeneity bridge and surjectivity. Bodies stay unexposed with `(rfl)`-stated def lemmas, the simp set is confluent toward the `DirectSum.of` normal form, and the relocated `pbwAssociatedGradedMap_surjective` leaves no forwarding shim.",
